OL,3,GNEWSATory support for Plaid government
OL,4,Abudget not ruled out by Badenoch
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch has
OL,7,Fnot ruled out the Welsh Tories helping
OL,8,FPlaid Cymru ministers to pass the Welsh
OL,9,Fgovernment's supplementary budget.
OL,11,FIn July, Plaid's mid-year spending
OL,12,Fplans were defeated in the Senedd after
OL,13,Fthey failed to secure enough opposition
OL,14,Fparty support for the changes.
OL,16,FOn Thursday, Badenoch told BBC Wales
OL,17,Fher party would always be willing to
OL,18,Fsupport "individual policies" where
OL,19,Fpeople are delivering things
OL,20,F"Conservative voters want".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
