OL,3,GNEWSATory support for Plaid government
OL,4,Abudget not ruled out by Badenoch
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut she insisted she was "not
OL,7,Finterested in doing deals" and that the
OL,8,FConservatives were the only "sensible
OL,9,Fparty in the Senedd".
